# ArangoDB AQL: ArangoDB documentation: AQL fundamentals; requirements/languages/aql.md
name     aql arangodb
keyword  FOR IN RETURN FILTER SORT LIMIT LET COLLECT INTO INSERT UPDATE REPLACE REMOVE UPSERT WITH
keyword  OUTBOUND INBOUND ANY GRAPH SHORTEST_PATH DISTINCT AGGREGATE AND OR NOT LIKE ASC DESC OPTIONS
builtin  true false null LENGTH COUNT SUM AVG CONCAT UPPER DATE_NOW DOCUMENT
fold-case
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
string   ` `  : name
sigil    @    : attr
operators  =<>!+-*/%.,:?()[]{}
calls
